%N A400516 Parking Schröder numbers.
%C A400516 The number of parking functions of length n that lead to parking permutations avoiding 1234 and 2134.
%H A400516 Lucy Martinez and Doron Zeilberger, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.28650">A parking function analog of the Schröder numbers</a>, arXiv:2609.28650 [math.CO], 2026.
