%F A400516 The recurrence is divided into cases and is too long to display here - see the Maple program.
%e A400516 For n=3, all 6 permutations avoid the patterns 1234 and 2134. Since all permutations are possible, there are 16 parking functions whose parking permutations avoid 1234 and 2134.
